  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 4615f8623ba4a6f42bf044c784618d23, type: 3}
  m_Name: Guide_ItemCodex
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::PopLife.Data.OperationGuideData
  guideId: Guide_ItemCodex
  displayName: Item Codex
  description: 
  icon: {fileID: 0}
  sortOrder: 100
  activationMarker: 23
  closingMarker: -1
  pages:
  - screenshot: {fileID: 21300000, guid: c6b26f92d9d93e247afb94a7614fb9db, type: 3}
    title: Item Codex
    body: 'This is the Item Codex. From here you can access information on every
      shelf item in the game! When you click on an item in the codex it will display:
      the name of the item, a picture of the item, the brand the item is made by,
      the item description, and sometimes useage instructions for the item.  '
  - screenshot: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 65a778f9599f5b240836572444d4e2f9, type: 3}
    title: Item Codex - Detail and Stats
    body: By Clicking the detail or stats button you can switch between description
      information of the item and its level 1 attributes.
  - screenshot: {fileID: 21300000, guid: c6b26f92d9d93e247afb94a7614fb9db, type: 3}
    title: Item Codex - New Item
    body: When you unlock a new item in the game it will automatically be added into
      the codex, and its label is shown in light blue color, representing new.
  - screenshot: {fileID: -6184308288810062334, guid: c81ed934d27ecac44b40a91316d40464, type: 3}
    title: Item Codex - Sorting
    body: 'At the top of the codex you can see category tabs. If you click on one
      it will sort the codex by that category. '
  - screenshot: {fileID: -275431863333609685, guid: 7fc599678a47a1e4e8c3f0079b39eb8f, type: 3}
    title: Item Codex - Searching
    body: 'There is also a search bar if you want to search for a specific item. '
  - screenshot: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 26d3265ca09d8614989cb0fcf57025fb, type: 3}
    title: Item Codex - Sorting
    body: By clicking on sort button you can sort the list in different ways.
